            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OF1MdnIh2ogZp7xiwczlkFKFgXf\">Overall, the percentages of both food and goods bought from supermarkets increased in most countries over the period shown. Country A experienced the most significant growth in both categories, while Country C maintained the lowest figures throughout the decade.</div>\n</div>",
